    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d159">

                <pb facs="0239" n="973" xml:id="pg973"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr.
                            Sill.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-11-20"><hi rendition="#italic">November 20,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Allen’s dispatches 156 and following received. Confine yourself strictly
                    protection of American citizens and interests. You have no concern in internal
                    affairs. Your actions to be taken independently of other representatives unless
                    otherwise instructed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
